[
  {
    "start": "00:00:15.599",
    "end": "00:00:18.870",
    "text": "scientific research is not just fun"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:18.880",
    "end": "00:00:21.670",
    "text": "scientific research really can save"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:21.680",
    "end": "00:00:24.470",
    "text": "human lives and that's very important to"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:24.480",
    "end": "00:00:25.540",
    "text": "me"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:25.550",
    "end": "00:00:29.269",
    "text": "[Music]"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:29.279",
    "end": "00:00:33.110",
    "text": "hi i'm dr gilbert and lin"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:33.120",
    "end": "00:00:34.310",
    "text": "or"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:34.320",
    "end": "00:00:37.120",
    "text": "my chinese name is simpler ling ning"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:37.130",
    "end": "00:00:38.630",
    "text": "[Music]"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:38.640",
    "end": "00:00:43.430",
    "text": "i was born in nanking china on december"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:43.440",
    "end": "00:00:46.389",
    "text": "26 1919"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:46.399",
    "end": "00:00:49.670",
    "text": "to a confucianist scholarly family"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:49.680",
    "end": "00:00:52.470",
    "text": "poetry and book family"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:52.480",
    "end": "00:00:53.910",
    "text": "when i was"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:53.920",
    "end": "00:00:57.110",
    "text": "only about a year old or so i want to"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:57.120",
    "end": "00:00:59.750",
    "text": "live with my grandparents a home"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:59.760",
    "end": "00:01:01.670",
    "text": "connected in nature"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:01.680",
    "end": "00:01:05.270",
    "text": "conrad lawrence discovered that the grey"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:05.280",
    "end": "00:01:07.429",
    "text": "goose hatched"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:07.439",
    "end": "00:01:11.990",
    "text": "on a certain time the 12th or 14th hour"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:12.000",
    "end": "00:01:14.789",
    "text": "anything that move is his parent"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:14.799",
    "end": "00:01:16.390",
    "text": "just imprinting"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:16.400",
    "end": "00:01:19.670",
    "text": "so in other words every living creature"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:19.680",
    "end": "00:01:23.590",
    "text": "as it develops has a moment the window"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:23.600",
    "end": "00:01:24.870",
    "text": "suddenly open"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:24.880",
    "end": "00:01:25.670",
    "text": "and"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:25.680",
    "end": "00:01:29.190",
    "text": "that moment will have a lasting impact"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:29.200",
    "end": "00:01:30.230",
    "text": "what"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:30.240",
    "end": "00:01:33.030",
    "text": "must have imprinted on me at the proper"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:33.040",
    "end": "00:01:36.149",
    "text": "time is to farm animals"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:36.159",
    "end": "00:01:37.109",
    "text": "so"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:37.119",
    "end": "00:01:40.149",
    "text": "ever since the beginning i have a deep"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:40.159",
    "end": "00:01:43.270",
    "text": "love which never left me later on it"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:43.280",
    "end": "00:01:44.630",
    "text": "gradually"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:44.640",
    "end": "00:01:46.630",
    "text": "expanded to include"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:46.640",
    "end": "00:01:48.469",
    "text": "young human"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:48.479",
    "end": "00:01:50.630",
    "text": "i love babies"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:50.640",
    "end": "00:01:53.590",
    "text": "and indeed this exposure to living"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:53.600",
    "end": "00:01:57.030",
    "text": "things left in me a deep fascination"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:57.040",
    "end": "00:02:00.310",
    "text": "with life which i never lost and from"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:00.320",
    "end": "00:02:03.350",
    "text": "there gradually i grew further into"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:03.360",
    "end": "00:02:05.990",
    "text": "trying to find more about these living"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:06.000",
    "end": "00:02:07.590",
    "text": "creatures"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:07.600",
    "end": "00:02:11.190",
    "text": "i entered university located in"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:11.200",
    "end": "00:02:12.550",
    "text": "chongqing"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:12.560",
    "end": "00:02:15.670",
    "text": "the japanese air force made a habit of"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:15.680",
    "end": "00:02:18.309",
    "text": "bombing chunking and they always want to"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:18.319",
    "end": "00:02:21.670",
    "text": "drop bombs on our university too after"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:21.680",
    "end": "00:02:23.830",
    "text": "days in the shelter"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:23.840",
    "end": "00:02:27.110",
    "text": "we came out to find roof is gone so we"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:27.120",
    "end": "00:02:31.270",
    "text": "will try to find tiles and to cover up"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:31.280",
    "end": "00:02:33.750",
    "text": "the part of"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:33.760",
    "end": "00:02:36.309",
    "text": "the building that we sleep under time"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:36.319",
    "end": "00:02:37.430",
    "text": "past"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:37.440",
    "end": "00:02:40.390",
    "text": "and next thing you know"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:40.400",
    "end": "00:02:43.190",
    "text": "i have already graduated with a bachelor"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:43.200",
    "end": "00:02:45.430",
    "text": "degree in biology"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:45.440",
    "end": "00:02:49.190",
    "text": "and i took part in an event which has"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:49.200",
    "end": "00:02:51.350",
    "text": "profound influence on the future of my"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:51.360",
    "end": "00:02:53.910",
    "text": "life it was scholarship for young"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:53.920",
    "end": "00:02:56.390",
    "text": "chinese to study"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:56.400",
    "end": "00:02:59.990",
    "text": "in america i was extremely lucky"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:00.000",
    "end": "00:03:03.030",
    "text": "in having won the scholarship for"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:03.040",
    "end": "00:03:07.030",
    "text": "biology in 1944 physiologist dr gilbert"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:07.040",
    "end": "00:03:09.030",
    "text": "ling won the coveted boxer indemnity"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:09.040",
    "end": "00:03:11.190",
    "text": "scholarship allowing him to emigrate to"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:11.200",
    "end": "00:03:14.070",
    "text": "the united states but at the time travel"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:14.080",
    "end": "00:03:15.910",
    "text": "from china wasn't as straightforward as"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:15.920",
    "end": "00:03:18.710",
    "text": "hopping on a transatlantic flight"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:18.720",
    "end": "00:03:22.710",
    "text": "we flew into kokoda india then"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:22.720",
    "end": "00:03:24.149",
    "text": "we were"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:24.159",
    "end": "00:03:27.830",
    "text": "on the boat to america it took a month"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:27.840",
    "end": "00:03:29.830",
    "text": "and we had met"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:29.840",
    "end": "00:03:33.509",
    "text": "storms after storm my friends and so on"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:33.519",
    "end": "00:03:34.630",
    "text": "were all"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:34.640",
    "end": "00:03:37.589",
    "text": "lying sick and i was very proud i was"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:37.599",
    "end": "00:03:38.550",
    "text": "able"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:38.560",
    "end": "00:03:41.350",
    "text": "to stand up and help to feed them"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:41.360",
    "end": "00:03:43.430",
    "text": "eventually we began to approach"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:43.440",
    "end": "00:03:46.869",
    "text": "manhattan and that impression of"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:46.879",
    "end": "00:03:48.149",
    "text": "manhattan"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:48.159",
    "end": "00:03:51.350",
    "text": "never was reproduced again it's just"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:51.360",
    "end": "00:03:53.190",
    "text": "unbelievable"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:53.200",
    "end": "00:03:54.229",
    "text": "our"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:54.239",
    "end": "00:03:57.750",
    "text": "9 000 mile automobile trip of the west"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:57.760",
    "end": "00:04:00.550",
    "text": "they they won the nobel prize in physics"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:00.560",
    "end": "00:04:02.789",
    "text": "along with the scholarship"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:02.799",
    "end": "00:04:04.789",
    "text": "we had the option"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:04.799",
    "end": "00:04:07.110",
    "text": "of choosing the professor"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:07.120",
    "end": "00:04:10.229",
    "text": "we wanted to study and i decided to"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:10.239",
    "end": "00:04:11.190",
    "text": "choose"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:11.200",
    "end": "00:04:13.270",
    "text": "university of chicago"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:13.280",
    "end": "00:04:14.390",
    "text": "and under"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:14.400",
    "end": "00:04:17.990",
    "text": "professor ralph w gerard there"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:18.000",
    "end": "00:04:21.590",
    "text": "i met my life companion shirley wong"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:21.600",
    "end": "00:04:24.469",
    "text": "who was going to be my wife"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:24.479",
    "end": "00:04:26.790",
    "text": "for 60 years"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:26.800",
    "end": "00:04:28.629",
    "text": "and my wedding"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:28.639",
    "end": "00:04:30.870",
    "text": "when we were first married"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:30.880",
    "end": "00:04:33.670",
    "text": "i was originally planning to return to"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:33.680",
    "end": "00:04:36.550",
    "text": "china however gross change in the"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:36.560",
    "end": "00:04:39.189",
    "text": "condition in china made it impossible"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:39.199",
    "end": "00:04:42.230",
    "text": "for me to return so i stayed on in the"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:42.240",
    "end": "00:04:45.110",
    "text": "united states to make use of what i"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:45.120",
    "end": "00:04:47.830",
    "text": "learned and to turn into something"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:47.840",
    "end": "00:04:50.070",
    "text": "useful to all mankind"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:50.080",
    "end": "00:04:52.550",
    "text": "at the university of chicago ling helped"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:52.560",
    "end": "00:04:54.710",
    "text": "to refine the glass capillary micro"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:54.720",
    "end": "00:04:57.350",
    "text": "electrode the once primitive tool turned"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:57.360",
    "end": "00:04:59.670",
    "text": "into a cornerstone of modern biology and"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:59.680",
    "end": "00:05:02.469",
    "text": "was attached to several nobel prize wins"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:02.479",
    "end": "00:05:04.310",
    "text": "though his future in science looked"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:04.320",
    "end": "00:05:06.390",
    "text": "bright ling was soon to learn the"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:06.400",
    "end": "00:05:09.110",
    "text": "consequences of challenging dogma"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:09.120",
    "end": "00:05:12.310",
    "text": "my phd work was on the electrical"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:12.320",
    "end": "00:05:16.550",
    "text": "potential of living cells i was asked"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:16.560",
    "end": "00:05:18.629",
    "text": "by the department"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:18.639",
    "end": "00:05:19.670",
    "text": "to give"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:19.680",
    "end": "00:05:22.950",
    "text": "a monday afternoon seminar talk and the"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:22.960",
    "end": "00:05:25.430",
    "text": "topic is the sodium pump"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:25.440",
    "end": "00:05:28.790",
    "text": "so i spent time in the library and red"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:28.800",
    "end": "00:05:31.909",
    "text": "and red or red the underlying theory was"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:31.919",
    "end": "00:05:35.590",
    "text": "a membrane theory up to that moment"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:35.600",
    "end": "00:05:38.469",
    "text": "the the cells were considered"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:38.479",
    "end": "00:05:40.150",
    "text": "like sips"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:40.160",
    "end": "00:05:44.150",
    "text": "this is called semi permeability it says"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:44.160",
    "end": "00:05:45.110",
    "text": "there are"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:45.120",
    "end": "00:05:48.790",
    "text": "only two kinds of molecules in the world"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:48.800",
    "end": "00:05:51.590",
    "text": "they either can go in or they cannot go"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:51.600",
    "end": "00:05:54.469",
    "text": "in and those that cannot go in will stay"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:54.479",
    "end": "00:05:58.230",
    "text": "out forever how long eternity"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:58.240",
    "end": "00:06:02.070",
    "text": "that just does not make good sense"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:02.080",
    "end": "00:06:03.590",
    "text": "and finally"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:03.600",
    "end": "00:06:06.710",
    "text": "monday afternoon came and i was"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:06.720",
    "end": "00:06:09.430",
    "text": "standing on the podium ready for my talk"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:09.440",
    "end": "00:06:11.990",
    "text": "on the sodium pump however the first"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:12.000",
    "end": "00:06:15.189",
    "text": "thing i said was to my audience who came"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:15.199",
    "end": "00:06:17.830",
    "text": "to hear about the sodium pump i said i"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:17.840",
    "end": "00:06:20.629",
    "text": "really have nothing to tell them there"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:20.639",
    "end": "00:06:24.070",
    "text": "is only a name there is no substance of"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:24.080",
    "end": "00:06:27.430",
    "text": "what the sodium bomb is how does it work"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:27.440",
    "end": "00:06:31.350",
    "text": "i was taken away by two of my"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:31.360",
    "end": "00:06:34.309",
    "text": "respected and beloved professors and"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:34.319",
    "end": "00:06:37.110",
    "text": "given the same advice and almost"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:37.120",
    "end": "00:06:40.710",
    "text": "verbatim each one tell me gilbert you"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:40.720",
    "end": "00:06:43.189",
    "text": "are a guy we all love and we don't want"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:43.199",
    "end": "00:06:46.390",
    "text": "you to spend your life as a model so"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:46.400",
    "end": "00:06:49.110",
    "text": "leave that sodium pump alone"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:49.120",
    "end": "00:06:52.790",
    "text": "it is a sacred cow what make"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:52.800",
    "end": "00:06:54.550",
    "text": "a part of science"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:54.560",
    "end": "00:06:56.230",
    "text": "a sacred cow"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:56.240",
    "end": "00:06:59.430",
    "text": "i took a long time and effort to come to"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:59.440",
    "end": "00:07:03.110",
    "text": "the united states i came to learn how to"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:03.120",
    "end": "00:07:04.469",
    "text": "do science"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:04.479",
    "end": "00:07:07.029",
    "text": "how can i just give up the integrity of"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:07.039",
    "end": "00:07:07.990",
    "text": "science"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:08.000",
    "end": "00:07:10.550",
    "text": "for the sake of not offending the sacred"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:10.560",
    "end": "00:07:13.029",
    "text": "cow gilbert went on to hold prominent"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:13.039",
    "end": "00:07:15.510",
    "text": "positions at world renowned institutions"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:15.520",
    "end": "00:07:18.230",
    "text": "over decades he formulated a radical new"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:18.240",
    "end": "00:07:19.990",
    "text": "theory on the workings of the cell"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:20.000",
    "end": "00:07:22.070",
    "text": "titled the association induction"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:22.080",
    "end": "00:07:24.870",
    "text": "hypothesis this theory reports that it's"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:24.880",
    "end": "00:07:26.629",
    "text": "the special arrangement of water and"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:26.639",
    "end": "00:07:28.629",
    "text": "proteins that account for the molecular"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:28.639",
    "end": "00:07:31.270",
    "text": "activities of the cell and not the pumps"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:31.280",
    "end": "00:07:33.430",
    "text": "and channels of a membrane but rather"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:33.440",
    "end": "00:07:35.189",
    "text": "than being taken seriously his"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:35.199",
    "end": "00:07:36.870",
    "text": "controversial theory marked the"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:36.880",
    "end": "00:07:39.110",
    "text": "dismantling of his career"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:39.120",
    "end": "00:07:41.589",
    "text": "at that time i had a whole laboratory"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:41.599",
    "end": "00:07:44.629",
    "text": "full of brighty on students who were"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:44.639",
    "end": "00:07:47.749",
    "text": "either doing their phd or doing postdoc"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:47.759",
    "end": "00:07:49.029",
    "text": "from all over the world the"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:49.039",
    "end": "00:07:50.790",
    "text": "establishment"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:50.800",
    "end": "00:07:54.150",
    "text": "simply made it impossible for me to get"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:54.160",
    "end": "00:07:57.749",
    "text": "money i had put my faith in science"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:57.759",
    "end": "00:08:00.390",
    "text": "and hope that i will get the support"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:00.400",
    "end": "00:08:02.869",
    "text": "suddenly i have nothing i was left out"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:02.879",
    "end": "00:08:04.469",
    "text": "downstream"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:04.479",
    "end": "00:08:07.589",
    "text": "when i told this to my wife and she said"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:07.599",
    "end": "00:08:10.390",
    "text": "gilbert we only have 45 dollars in the"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:10.400",
    "end": "00:08:13.029",
    "text": "bank despite losing his position and his"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:13.039",
    "end": "00:08:16.070",
    "text": "salary in 1988 dr ling continued to"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:16.080",
    "end": "00:08:18.150",
    "text": "study how life works at the deepest"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:18.160",
    "end": "00:08:20.629",
    "text": "level with his pioneering work inspiring"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:20.639",
    "end": "00:08:23.270",
    "text": "a new generation of scientists and in"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:23.280",
    "end": "00:08:25.110",
    "text": "perhaps the greatest testament to his"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:25.120",
    "end": "00:08:27.589",
    "text": "work raymond damadian the inventor of"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:27.599",
    "end": "00:08:30.230",
    "text": "the first full body mri credited him"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:30.240",
    "end": "00:08:32.790",
    "text": "with their discovery i got a couple of"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:32.800",
    "end": "00:08:34.469",
    "text": "gilbert's books"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:34.479",
    "end": "00:08:36.230",
    "text": "they're not easy to read"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:36.240",
    "end": "00:08:39.430",
    "text": "it took me five tries"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:39.440",
    "end": "00:08:42.389",
    "text": "i finally worked out what he was saying"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:42.399",
    "end": "00:08:45.670",
    "text": "and it's you know phenomenal i think"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:45.680",
    "end": "00:08:48.150",
    "text": "gilbert ling is a genius and he's an"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:48.160",
    "end": "00:08:50.949",
    "text": "immensely intellectual honest man"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:50.959",
    "end": "00:08:54.070",
    "text": "his contributions to science are so"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:54.080",
    "end": "00:08:56.310",
    "text": "immense that he should have been given a"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:56.320",
    "end": "00:08:59.509",
    "text": "nobel prize he was really like a litmus"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:59.519",
    "end": "00:09:02.710",
    "text": "test for how anti-scientific a professor"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:02.720",
    "end": "00:09:03.509",
    "text": "was"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:03.519",
    "end": "00:09:06.829",
    "text": "how readily they would dispose his whole"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:06.839",
    "end": "00:09:09.990",
    "text": "position if science is even partly wrong"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:10.000",
    "end": "00:09:11.990",
    "text": "about something as fundamental as the"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:12.000",
    "end": "00:09:13.829",
    "text": "workings of our cells it's not"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:13.839",
    "end": "00:09:15.590",
    "text": "surprising that cures for some of the"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:15.600",
    "end": "00:09:19.750",
    "text": "most devastating diseases still elude us"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:19.760",
    "end": "00:09:22.630",
    "text": "the most interesting thing to me is how"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:22.640",
    "end": "00:09:24.230",
    "text": "to make"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:24.240",
    "end": "00:09:27.350",
    "text": "what i discovered to last"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:27.360",
    "end": "00:09:29.590",
    "text": "to the future generation"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:29.600",
    "end": "00:09:31.910",
    "text": "because the worst condition when i"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:31.920",
    "end": "00:09:33.829",
    "text": "passed away the whole thing would"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:33.839",
    "end": "00:09:35.110",
    "text": "disappear"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:35.120",
    "end": "00:09:37.509",
    "text": "but i intend to be alone here a longer"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:37.519",
    "end": "00:09:39.510",
    "text": "time"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:39.520",
    "end": "00:09:55.590",
    "text": "[Music]"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:55.600",
    "end": "00:10:11.590",
    "text": "okay"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:11.600",
    "end": "00:10:13.680",
    "text": "you"
  }
]